        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCNEW, Arc Rose with Newport Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rope Newport Lever with Arc Rose is one of those great examples of door hardware that makes you imagine the architecture of a place. In this case, the Arc Rose with Newport Lever seems to be made with the Hamptons in mind. It is beachy, elegant, and traditional in only the way that mansions in New England can be. The Arc Short Plate with Newport Lever will fit most pre-drill doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCNEW Arc Short Plate with Newport Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Lever with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCNEW-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262388\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCNEW Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rope Newport Lever with Arc Rose",
                "description": "The Rope Newport Lever with Arc Rose is one of those great examples of door hardware that makes you imagine the architecture of a place. In this case, the Arc Rose with Newport Lever seems to be made with the Hamptons in mind. It is beachy, elegant, and traditional in only the way that mansions in New England can be. The Arc Short Plate with Newport Lever will fit most pre-drill doors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
